# Doom Reigns Supreme's "target opponent exiles the top five cards of their library" with fewer than five there: Bot2's
# library holds only three cards by turn 5 (Lightning Bolt, Ornithopter, Ancestral Recall), so those three are exiled and
# Bot1 may cast up to two of them free - the Ornithopter and the Bolt (at Bot2) - and the Ancestral Recall stays in exile.
# The rest is as in the main scenario: five Villain entries drain Bot2 to 15 before the Bolt.

